# Python bytecode cache: verify.py imports fit.py (scripts/font-fit/), which
# would otherwise leave a __pycache__/ in the tree. run.sh also sets
# PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1, so this is the second line of defence.
__pycache__/
